{
    "title": "Sea of Conquest: Pirate War",
    "description": "Step aboard SEA OF CONQUEST!\r\n\r\nEmbark on an extraordinary maritime odyssey through the captivating Devil's Seas. Sail into uncharted territories, assume the role of Captain, and immerse yourself in exhilarating adventures. Build your cabin, assemble a mighty fleet, and customize your majestic Flagship. Prepare for awe-inspiring encounters, heroic duels, and adrenaline-charged clashes with fellow pirates.\r\n\r\nTHRILLING ADVENTURES UNFOLD:\r\n\r\nGLOBAL EXPEDITIONS: UNVEIL PORTS & EXCITING CHALLENGES\r\nUnleash your wanderlust and embark on an inspiring global escapade. Traverse the treacherous waters of the Devil's Sea, and push the boundaries to reach the farthest corners of the world. Prepare to conquer unforeseen challenges and immerse yourself in captivating new storylines!\r\n\r\nCRAFT YOUR FLAGSHIP: BECOME A PIRATE LEGEND\r\nForge your own path to piracy by meticulously crafting your majestic flagship. Every detail, from the fluttering flag to the formidable armaments you choose to wield, reflects your unique style and strategic prowess. With your personalized flagship, you shall fearlessly withstand raids and monstrous encounters, paving the way to become the unrivaled king of all pirates! Don't miss out on the thrilling weekly Pirate Revel event, where fulfilling grand orders of delectable food and refreshing drinks can shower you with abundant rewards!\r\n\r\nUNITE YOUR FEARLESS CREW: EMBARK ON AN EPIC JOURNEY\r\nAhoy, ready to step into the legendary shoes of a pirate captain? With a diverse and spirited crew by your side, set sail on grand adventures across the seven seas. The exhilaration of treasure hunts in search of coveted riches awaits you. Will it be gleaming gold, exquisite pearls, rare materials, or perhaps an enigmatic drifting bottle that unravels tales of untold fortunes? It's your destiny to find out!\r\n\r\nHEROIC TRIALS & ROGUE'S RUMBLE: BOOST YOUR POWER!\r\nAs a dauntless Captain, you'll be drawn into the heart-pounding Hero Trials. Conquer each level as you expertly assemble your team of heroes and strategically command your assaults. Brace yourself for the Rogue's Rumble, an inferno of valor and hard-earned triumphs. This is a battle and a test of your courage and tactical genius! Are you up for the challenge?\r\n\r\nPLUNGE INTO BATTLE: YOUR CHALLENGE AWAITS, CAPTAIN!\r\nPrepare for the exhilarating rush of adrenaline as a fearless Captain, engaging in intense naval battles against rival pirates, formidable navies, and unpredictable sea monsters. The thrill of conquest awaits as you seize ports, sentry towers, and strategic passages. With new trading alliances looming on the horizon, the excitement never ceases! Rise to the challenge in the cyclical Showdown o'Gangs event, where alliances compete for glory and rewards!\r\n\r\nANSWER THE CALL OF THE SEA: EMBARK ON THE PIRATE'S QUEST FOR TREASURE!\r\nAre you ready to feel the exhilaration of the ultimate treasure hunt? As a seasoned pirate, the vast sea becomes your playground. Envision leading your crew, engaging in battles against sea creatures and rival pirates, all in the relentless pursuit of concealed fortunes. Decipher cryptic maps, unravel the enigmas of the sea and plunge into the ultimate adventure.\r\n\r\nReputation, glory, and wealth await amidst the uncharted realm, eagerly awaiting your command to become the best pirate ever! Come and discover the extraordinary secrets the Devil's Sea has in store for you!\r\n\r\nNeed assistance, matey?\r\nFeel free to contact us via the in-game Customer Service or send us an email at: seaofconquestcs@funplus.com\r\nFor more fun, join the pirates' gangs!\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/seaofconquest\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/seaofconquest\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/sea.of.conquest/\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/seaofconquest\r\nOfficial Website: https://seaofconquest.com\r\n\r\nTerms and Conditions: https://funplus.com/funplus-general-campaign-terms-and-conditions\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://funplus.com/privacy-policies/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Step aboard SEA OF CONQUEST!<br><br>Embark on an extraordinary maritime odyssey through the captivating Devil&#39;s Seas. Sail into uncharted territories, assume the role of Captain, and immerse yourself in exhilarating adventures. Build your cabin, assemble a mighty fleet, and customize your majestic Flagship. Prepare for awe-inspiring encounters, heroic duels, and adrenaline-charged clashes with fellow pirates.<br><br>THRILLING ADVENTURES UNFOLD:<br><br>GLOBAL EXPEDITIONS: UNVEIL PORTS &amp; EXCITING CHALLENGES<br>Unleash your wanderlust and embark on an inspiring global escapade. Traverse the treacherous waters of the Devil&#39;s Sea, and push the boundaries to reach the farthest corners of the world. Prepare to conquer unforeseen challenges and immerse yourself in captivating new storylines!<br><br>CRAFT YOUR FLAGSHIP: BECOME A PIRATE LEGEND<br>Forge your own path to piracy by meticulously crafting your majestic flagship. Every detail, from the fluttering flag to the formidable armaments you choose to wield, reflects your unique style and strategic prowess. With your personalized flagship, you shall fearlessly withstand raids and monstrous encounters, paving the way to become the unrivaled king of all pirates! Don&#39;t miss out on the thrilling weekly Pirate Revel event, where fulfilling grand orders of delectable food and refreshing drinks can shower you with abundant rewards!<br><br>UNITE YOUR FEARLESS CREW: EMBARK ON AN EPIC JOURNEY<br>Ahoy, ready to step into the legendary shoes of a pirate captain? With a diverse and spirited crew by your side, set sail on grand adventures across the seven seas. The exhilaration of treasure hunts in search of coveted riches awaits you. Will it be gleaming gold, exquisite pearls, rare materials, or perhaps an enigmatic drifting bottle that unravels tales of untold fortunes? It&#39;s your destiny to find out!<br><br>HEROIC TRIALS &amp; ROGUE&#39;S RUMBLE: BOOST YOUR POWER!<br>As a dauntless Captain, you&#39;ll be drawn into the heart-pounding Hero Trials. Conquer each level as you expertly assemble your team of heroes and strategically command your assaults. Brace yourself for the Rogue&#39;s Rumble, an inferno of valor and hard-earned triumphs. This is a battle and a test of your courage and tactical genius! Are you up for the challenge?<br><br>PLUNGE INTO BATTLE: YOUR CHALLENGE AWAITS, CAPTAIN!<br>Prepare for the exhilarating rush of adrenaline as a fearless Captain, engaging in intense naval battles against rival pirates, formidable navies, and unpredictable sea monsters. The thrill of conquest awaits as you seize ports, sentry towers, and strategic passages. With new trading alliances looming on the horizon, the excitement never ceases! Rise to the challenge in the cyclical Showdown o&#39;Gangs event, where alliances compete for glory and rewards!<br><br>ANSWER THE CALL OF THE SEA: EMBARK ON THE PIRATE&#39;S QUEST FOR TREASURE!<br>Are you ready to feel the exhilaration of the ultimate treasure hunt? As a seasoned pirate, the vast sea becomes your playground. Envision leading your crew, engaging in battles against sea creatures and rival pirates, all in the relentless pursuit of concealed fortunes. Decipher cryptic maps, unravel the enigmas of the sea and plunge into the ultimate adventure.<br><br>Reputation, glory, and wealth await amidst the uncharted realm, eagerly awaiting your command to become the best pirate ever! Come and discover the extraordinary secrets the Devil&#39;s Sea has in store for you!<br><br>Need assistance, matey?<br>Feel free to contact us via the in-game Customer Service or send us an email at: seaofconquestcs@funplus.com<br>For more fun, join the pirates&#39; gangs!<br>Discord: https://discord.gg/seaofconquest<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/seaofconquest<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/sea.of.conquest/<br>Twitter: https://twitter.com/seaofconquest<br>Official Website: https://seaofconquest.com<br><br>Terms and Conditions: https://funplus.com/funplus-general-campaign-terms-and-conditions<br>Privacy Policy: https://funplus.com/privacy-policies/",
